  "name": "Medical Release: Acid Armor",
  "type": "jutsu",
  "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
  "system": {
    "identifier": "medical-release-acid-armor",
    "description": "<p>You manifest acidic chakra in the form of a highly dangerous aura of chakra that intercepts attacks for you and harms those who would try to touch you.</p>\n<p>You gain 10 temporary hit points. Each time a creature deals damage to you with a melee attack, they take 6 acid damage while you have temporary hit points granted by this jutsu.</p>\n<p>Additionally, while you have temporary hit points granted by this jutsu, you can spend your Bonus action to perform an Acid Tail attack.</p>\n<p>Acid Tail. Make one melee ninjutsu attack. Compare the result of your attack against all creatures in a 15-foot cone, originating from you. Each affected creature takes 2d6 + 6 acid damage and must make a Constitution Saving throw being Corroded on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the temporary hit points by 5 and the acid damage dealt by the armor by 3 and the Acid Tail by 1d6.</p>",
